      "content": "hey, i have a big presentation coming up tomorrow and i'm getting super nervous. my hands are shaking like crazy and my heart is racing... i have some propranolol left over from a while ago, would it be okay to take a pill to help stop the tremors so i can get through the talk? i also have asthma but it's pretty well controlled with my inhaler.",
