    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that. but like, i only have moderate asthma and i use my inhaler regularly, so it's not like i'm always wheezing. if i took a really small dose, like like half a pill, would that be enough to stop the shakes without actually causing an asthma attack? it seems like the risk would be pretty low if the dose is tiny and my asthma is managed.",
